          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Famous Quotes</h1>\n    <p>“When one door of happiness closes, another opens; but often we look so long at the closed door that we do not see the one which has been opened for us.”</p>\n    <h3>-Helen Keller</h3>\n    <p>Humans are allergic to change. They love to say, \"We've always done it this way.\" I try to fight that. That's why I have a clock on my wall that runs counter-clockwise.\n    </p>\n    <h3>-Grace Hopper, Computing Pioneer</h3>\n  </body>\n</html>",
